		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Bonjour,</p><p>l&#039;index est refusé</p><div class="codebox"><pre><code>abotest=# CREATE INDEX idx_pr_hid_ref ON products ((hidden,rtrim(reference)||&#039; V&#039;||version,owner,id));
ERROR:  syntax error at or near &quot;,&quot;
LINE 1: CREATE INDEX idx_pr_hid_ref ON products ((hidden,rtrim(refer...
                                                        ^</code></pre></div><p>Quelqu&#039;un peut me dire pourquoi?</p><br /><p>Merci.</p>]]></content>
